    "title": "‘It’s like the 16th-century version of doomscrolling’: the Book of Miracles may fetch £1m at auction",
    "summary": "A rare 16th-century illustrated manuscript, the Book of Miracles, is expected to fetch around £1m at auction, with public institutions given first chance to bid. Its paintings show extraordinary skies and weather, such as five suns over Leipzig in 1551, blood rain on Rome in 1456 and giant hailstones battering a Dutch city.",
